---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Expat Health Insurance in Cambodia | AG Cambodia"
  description="Long-term international health insurance for expats in Cambodia. Compare APRIL, ACS and LUMA plans for quality care in Cambodia, the region and worldwide."
  quoteHref="/health-insurance-cambodia/long-term-insurance-cambodia-for-expats/form/"
>
  <!-- Page hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-hero-grid">
        <div class="page-hero-copy">
          <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
            <a href="/">Home</a>
            <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
            <a href="/health-insurance-cambodia/">Health Insurance</a>
            <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
            <span>Long-Term Insurance for Expats</span>
          </nav>
          <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Health Insurance – Private Insurance</p>
          <h1>International Health Insurance</h1>
          <p class="hero-lead">Living in Cambodia is generally straightforward, until you need medical treatment. Quality private healthcare is available, but serious treatment can quickly become expensive, good medical care here comes at international prices, and the right hospital network can be the difference between a manageable bill and a financial shock. In some situations, you may also need to travel elsewhere in Southeast Asia for specialist care.</p>
          <div class="hero-ctas">
            <a href="#why-choose" class="btn btn-outline-light">Read more</a>
            <a href="/health-insurance-cambodia/long-term-insurance-cambodia-for-expats/form/" class="btn btn-gold">Get a free quote</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="page-hero-visual">
          <img src="/assets/private-health-insurance.webp" alt="Doctor and nurse reviewing patient records on a tablet" width="600" height="400" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why choose AG -->
  <section class="section" id="why-choose">
    <div class="container article-grid">
      <div class="article-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Why choose AG Insurance Broker?</p>
        <h2>More than paying hospital bills</h2>
        <p>That is why the right health insurance is about more than simply paying hospital bills. It is about knowing where you can be treated, what your insurer will actually cover, and what happens if the care you need isn't available locally — and having a broker on the ground who knows the answers.</p>
        <p>For 20 years, AG Insurance Broker has helped expatriates, individuals and families in Cambodia answer exactly those questions. We know the local hospital network, the doctors and the care pathways in detail, and we work only with established international insurers selected among the leaders in their market, solid, reliable and responsive solutions, backed by a local team on hand to facilitate pre-authorisations and reimbursements. All our solutions guarantee renewal, whatever your claims history.</p>
        <p>We take a comprehensive approach to understanding your personal, family or corporate healthcare needs, considering individual circumstances, medical history and long-term protection requirements. Our expertise enables us to recommend insurance solutions that provide appropriate and sustainable healthcare protection.</p>
        <p>Our plans give you access to trusted local and regional hospital networks, structured across local, regional (Southeast Asia) and worldwide cover, including medical evacuation. Plans can include dependants and family cover and maternity options, with a claims process built around direct billing; so the clinics you actually use are paid directly by the insurer, rather than leaving you to fund treatment and reclaim it later.</p>
        <a href="/health-insurance-cambodia/long-term-insurance-cambodia-for-expats/form/" class="btn btn-gold">Get a free quote</a>
      </div>

      <aside class="peril-card">
        <h3>With AG Cambodia</h3>
        <ul class="peril-list">
          <li>Local, regional (Southeast Asia) or worldwide cover</li>
          <li>Medical evacuation included</li>
          <li>Direct billing with the clinics you use</li>
          <li>Family cover and maternity options</li>
          <li>Guaranteed renewal, whatever your claims history</li>
          <li>A local team for pre-authorisations and reimbursements</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What can be covered -->
  <section class="section section-cream">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Your cover</p>
      <h2>What can be covered</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">Depending on the plan you choose, your cover can include treatment in Cambodia, throughout Southeast Asia or worldwide, together with medical evacuation when required.</p>

      <div class="cov-grid">
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 21V8l8-5 8 5v13M12 9v6M9 12h6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>
          <h3>Hospitalisation</h3>
          <p>Cover for inpatient treatment, including hospital stays, surgery, intensive care, specialist fees and prescribed medication while admitted.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6 3v6a6 6 0 0 0 12 0V3M12 15v3a3 3 0 0 0 6 0v-1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path><circle cx="18" cy="15" r="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"></circle></svg></span>
          <h3>Outpatient Care</h3>
          <p>Cover for everyday medical treatment such as doctor visits, specialist consultations, diagnostic tests, laboratory work, X-rays and prescribed medication.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M3 13h3l2-4 3 8 2-5h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>
          <h3>Emergency Care &amp; Evacuation</h3>
          <p>Protection for emergency treatment, ambulance services and, where included, medical evacuation to an appropriate medical facility.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="3.4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"></circle><path d="M6 21c.6-4.6 3-7 6-7s5.4 2.4 6 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span>
          <h3>Maternity</h3>
          <p>Selected plans can include prenatal care, delivery, postnatal treatment and pregnancy-related complications, with newborn cover available under some policies.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M7 3c-2.5 0-4 2-4 4.5 0 3 1.5 4 2 7 .5 3 1 6.5 2.5 6.5S9 17 12 17s3 4 4.5 4S18.5 17.5 19 14.5c.5-3 2-4 2-7C21 5 19.5 3 17 3c-2 0-3 1-5 1S9 3 7 3Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>
          <h3>Dental &amp; Optical</h3>
          <p>Optional benefits may include routine dental treatment, fillings and extractions, as well as eye examinations and allowances for prescription glasses or lenses.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2 3 6v6c0 5 3.8 8.7 9 10 5.2-1.3 9-5 9-10V6l-9-4Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="m8.5 12 2.5 2.5 4.5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>
          <h3>Preventive Care &amp; Wellness</h3>
          <p>Some plans also include health screenings, vaccinations and ongoing support for certain chronic conditions.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Plan levels -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Choose your IPMI plan</p>
      <h2>Three levels of international health insurance</h2>

      <div class="plan-grid">
        <article class="plan-card">
          <h3>A — Hospitalisation + Medical Evacuation</h3>
          <p class="plan-card-desc">This is the most straightforward level of private health insurance. It protects you against the cost of serious illness, accidents or medical conditions requiring hospital admission: inpatient treatment such as surgery, hospital accommodation, intensive care and other eligible hospital expenses. Medical evacuation is included as standard in the plans we offer, giving you an essential safety net should the treatment you need not be available locally.</p>
          <p class="plan-card-desc">Outpatient consultations, routine doctor visits and prescriptions are generally not covered at this level.</p>
          <div class="plan-best-for">
            <strong>Best suited to</strong>
            <span>People looking for essential protection against major medical expenses while keeping their insurance premium under control.</span>
          </div>
          <a href="/health-insurance-cambodia/long-term-insurance-cambodia-for-expats/form/" class="btn btn-gold btn-block">Get a free quote</a>
        </article>
        <article class="plan-card">
          <h3>B — Comprehensive Health Insurance + Medical Evacuation</h3>
          <p class="plan-card-desc">Should you want broader access to private healthcare, a comprehensive plan combines hospitalisation cover with outpatient treatment. Alongside inpatient care, your policy can cover visits to general practitioners and specialists, diagnostic examinations and prescribed medication. Depending on the insurer and level selected, additional benefits such as physiotherapy or mental health treatment may also be available.</p>
          <div class="plan-best-for">
            <strong>Best suited to</strong>
            <span>People who want broader access to private healthcare, with outpatient treatment as well as hospital cover.</span>
          </div>
          <a href="/health-insurance-cambodia/long-term-insurance-cambodia-for-expats/form/" class="btn btn-gold btn-block">Get a free quote</a>
        </article>
        <article class="plan-card">
          <h3>C — Comprehensive Health Insurance + Maternity + Medical Evacuation</h3>
          <p class="plan-card-desc">Should you be planning to start or grow your family, maternity cover can be added to selected comprehensive plans. Depending on the policy, maternity benefits can include prenatal and postnatal care, normal delivery, Caesarean delivery and certain newborn or pregnancy-related complications. Maternity cover normally needs to be arranged in advance, so it's particularly important to discuss your plans with us before pregnancy.</p>
          <div class="plan-best-for">
            <strong>Best suited to</strong>
            <span>Individuals and couples planning a pregnancy who want access to private maternity care as part of their international health insurance.</span>
          </div>
          <a href="/health-insurance-cambodia/long-term-insurance-cambodia-for-expats/form/" class="btn btn-gold btn-block">Get a free quote</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Medical evacuation -->
  <section class="section section-cream">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">We explain</p>
      <h2>Why medical evacuation matters in Cambodia</h2>
      <div class="article-copy" style="margin-top: 28px; max-width: 72ch;">
        <p>Medical evacuation is one of the most important elements of health insurance in Cambodia. Many conditions can be treated locally, but there are situations where the appropriate specialist, facility or treatment simply isn't available. Should this happen, medical evacuation cover arranges and pays for an eligible transfer to an appropriate medical facility, subject to the terms of your policy and medical approval from the insurer, with our local team on hand to help coordinate the process.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="notice-box">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2 3 6v6c0 5 3.8 8.7 9 10 5.2-1.3 9-5 9-10V6l-9-4Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
        <p><strong>Included in every plan.</strong> Without adequate insurance, an emergency medical evacuation can represent a very significant personal expense. That is why medical evacuation is included in every international health insurance solution offered through AG Insurance Broker.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Talk to our advisors -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Need more information?</p>
      <h2>Talk to our health insurance advisors</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">Prefer to talk it through? Our local advisors — including Marc, Marie, and Sokchan — are on hand to walk you through the right plan for your situation.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="/health-insurance-cambodia/long-term-insurance-cambodia-for-expats/form/" class="btn btn-gold">Get a Quote</a>
        <a href="tel:+85523998018" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Call us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact / Quote -->
  <section class="section quote-section" id="form">
    <div class="container quote-grid">
      <div class="quote-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Get a quote</p>
        <h2>Your free private health insurance quote</h2>
        <p class="section-lead section-lead-light">Tell us about your situation. Compare offers from multiple A-rated insurers with clear, professional advice.</p>
        <ul class="check-list check-list-light">
          <li>We compare 15+ insurers to get you the best rate</li>
          <li>Available in French and English</li>
          <li>Officially licensed and registered in Cambodia</li>
          <li>Fully confidential — your request is never spammed</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="quote-cta-row">
          <a href="https://t.me/AGCambodia" class="btn btn-outline-light" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M21 4 3 11l6 2m12-9-4 16-8-6m0 0 3-2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            Telegram
          </a>
          <a href="tel:+85523998018" class="btn btn-outline-light">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6.6 10.8c1.4 2.8 3.8 5.2 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1C10.9 21 3 13.1 3 3.5c0-.6.4-1 1-1H7.7c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.4 0 .8-.2 1L6.6 10.8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            Call us
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="quote-form-card">
        <p class="quote-form-title">Company &amp; get covered</p>
        <p class="quote-form-sub">Tell us a bit about your needs and a broker will call you back within 24 hours.</p>

        <div class="quote-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Insurance type">
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab is-active" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Health Insurance</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Vehicle</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Property</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Other</button>
        </div>

        <form id="quote-form" novalidate>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="firstName">First name *</label>
              <input id="firstName" name="firstName" type="text" required autocomplete="given-name" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="lastName">Last name *</label>
              <input id="lastName" name="lastName" type="text" required autocomplete="family-name" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="email">Email *</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="phone">Phone / WhatsApp *</label>
              <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" required autocomplete="tel" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="message">Message</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4"></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-gold btn-block">Request my free quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
          <p class="form-note">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="9" rx="1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></rect><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg>
            Your information is 100% confidential
          </p>
          <p class="form-status" id="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
